{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clingy Back-Spirit&quot;\u00a0\u2013 A short horror-comedy game about exorcists, curses, and one very clingy ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010 What is &quot;Clingy Back-Spirit&quot;? \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/extras/f64aba7055242b4879d90670326cf78c.avif?t=1759792959\" width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clingy Back-Spirit&quot; is a short <strong>horror-comedy adventure</strong> where you, an exorcist, must break the curse haunting a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds simple enough... except the place has turned into a <strong>paradise for angry spirits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, good luck. You\u2019ll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010 Your Loyal Back-Spirit, Ryuji \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/extras/1c0757a91e0a0e813328f3f437280d89.avif?t=1759792959\" width=1560 height=681 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cheeky ghost buddy <strong>Ryuji</strong> is always by your side\u2014and always talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s sensitive to curses and can sense danger faster than you can blink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely to his ridiculous stories... they might just save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voice Cast:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Takumi</strong> \u2014 Keisuke Akai</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ryuji</strong> \u2014 Setsugekka</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil Spirits</strong> \u2014 Mikaze Nekoyashiki</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About <strong>30 minutes</strong> \u2013 like watching one anime episode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endings:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only <strong>one ending</strong>, but plenty of chaos getting there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Story Summary\u00a0]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/extras/aeb4dd0c55596fca7ad494c283b414ef.avif?t=1759792959\" width=1560 height=676 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even star exorcists have bills to pay.<br>This time, you\u2019ve sworn to take <i>any</i> job that comes your way...<br>...but nobody said it would be <strong>a cursed haunted house</strong>, Ryuji!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Disclaimer ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>sudden scares</strong> and <strong>crude humor</strong> equivalent to a <i>teen-rated comic</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play responsibly\u2014we take no responsibility for exorcism-related trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Streaming Guidelines ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>welcome to stream, post gameplay videos, and monetize content</strong> featuring this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is needed. Have fun\u2014and try not to get cursed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474310?t=1759792959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474310?t=1759792959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/82a38922863a1bc6e43f5affdab4976b83